{"ts": 1794123067.3987908, "action": "SET", "key": "task_message", "value": "Research and verify the Light-Story system using agent-system and folder-agent, then generate detailed high‑availability ideas to implement and complete the TL;DR Recommendations: (1) keep current normalized core, (2) denormalize hot counters, (3) add hash‑partitioning on chapters >5M rows, (4) consider Redis hot‑counter sync, (5) create materialised view for stories+tags, (6) enable Supabase read replicas and route reads via Workers, (7) monitor index bloat and re‑index. Produce a concrete plan, spec, and code snippets where appropriate."}
