{"ts": 1794123716.9350638, "action": "SET", "key": "task_message", "value": "Research system with agent-system and folder-agent, generate ideas to update and complete the checklist: 1. Prefix /api/v1/ for new routes. 2. Add middleware in Cloudflare Worker for JWT auth, Idempotency-Key, logging, rate‑limit. 3. Update OpenAPI docs on endpoint changes. 4. Use select(..., { count: 'exact' }) for pagination. 5. Apply standardized error JSON responses. 6. Version lock: create v2 branch on breaking changes, update README, deprecate. 7. Protect admin actions with requireActionRole + RLS, expose via Server‑Actions only."}
